'''Welcome!''' (よくきたな！, ''Yoku Kitana！'', '''Well Done!''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.6 Update|Update 15.6]].

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (Sm): Cats' movement speed increases by 10%.

